// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// MainScreen
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
export component MainScreen inherits Rectangle {
    background: #F0F7FF;

    // ── Callbacks ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    callback logout();
    callback load-file();
    callback batch-folder();
    callback new-client() -> bool;
    callback auto-classify();
    callback ai-classify();
    callback view-rules();
    callback import-history();
    callback import-ledgers();
    callback filter-changed(string);
    callback date-filter-apply(string, string);
    callback date-preset(string);
    callback bank-filter-changed(string);
    callback vendor-filter-changed(string);
    callback head-filter-changed(string);
    callback drill-filter(string);  // dashboard stat row drill-down: sets filter + switches to txns view
    callback export-excel();
    callback export-tally();
    callback export-accounting();
    callback export-preview();    // recomputes the export summary line for wizard step 4
    callback toggle-status(string);  // multi-status filter toggle
    callback reimport-excel();
    callback reset-dedupe();
    callback reconcile();
    callback run-reconciliation();
    callback open-batch-monitor();
    callback open-audit-trail(int, int);
    callback open-settings();
    callback add-row();
    callback load-all();
    callback download-logs();
    callback export-recon-csv();
    // Row editing
    callback row-click(int);
    callback save-txn(int, string, string, string, bool);
    callback delete-txn(int);
    callback mark-suspense(int);
    callback add-txn(string, string, string, string, string, string, string, string);
    // Client management
    callback select-client(string);
    callback delete-client();
    callback edit-client();
    // Import history reload
    callback reload-import(int);
    callback delete-import(int);
    // Settings save (provider, api-key, enabled)
    callback settings-save(string, string, bool);
    // Rules backup / restore
    callback backup-rules();
    callback restore-rules();
    callback delete-rule(int);

    // ── Data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    in property <[string]> client-names: ["-- Select Client --"];
    // New client fields — in-out so Rust can read them back in do-new-client
    in-out property <string> new-client-name:   "";
    in-out property <string> new-client-ledger: "";
    // AI settings fields — in-out so Rust can read provider + key after modal closes
    in-out property <int>    ai-provider-idx: 0;
    in-out property <string> ai-api-key:      "";
    in-out property <int>    ai-scope-idx:    0;
    // Import history + rules records set by Rust
    in property <[string]> import-records: [];
    in property <[string]> rule-records:   [];
    in property <string>   status-bank:  "";
    in property <string>   status-file:  "";
    in property <[TxnRow]>  transaction-rows: [];
    in property <[string]> bank-names: ["All Banks"];

    in property <string> dash-bank-name:    "";
    in property <string> dash-opening:      "\u{20B9} \u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-credits:      "\u{20B9} \u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-debits:       "\u{20B9} \u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-closing:      "\u{20B9} \u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-txn-count:    "\u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-vendors:      "\u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-client-name:  "";
    in property <string> dash-account-no:   "";
    in property <string> dash-period:       "\u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-credit-count: "\u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-debit-count:  "\u{2014}";
    in property <string> dash-unreviewed:   "0";
    in property <string> dash-suspense:     "0";
    in property <bool>   dash-has-suspense: false;
    in property <string> dash-needs-review: "0";
    in property <string> dash-duplicates:   "0";
    in property <string> dash-gst-count:    "0";
    in property <string> dash-calc-closing: "\u{20B9} \u{2014}";
    in property <bool>   dash-has-mismatch: false;
    in property <string> dash-mismatch:     "";

    // ── Dashboard chart data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
    in property <string> dash-net-flow:       "₹ —";
    in property <string> dash-top-expense:    "—";
    in property <string> dash-top-exp-amt:    "";
    in property <bool>   dash-has-data:       false;
    in property <[DashMonthBar]>  dash-chart-monthly:  [];
    in property <[DashExpBar]>    dash-chart-expenses: [];
    in property <[DashCashPt]>    dash-chart-cashflow: [];
    in property <[DashVendorBar]> dash-chart-vendors:  [];
    in property <[string]> dash-chart-monthly-y-ticks:  [];
    in property <[string]> dash-chart-cashflow-y-ticks: [];
    in property <[string]> dash-chart-vendors-x-ticks:  [];
    in property <[string]> dash-filter-banks:   ["All Banks"];
    in property <[string]> dash-filter-vendors: ["All Vendors"];
    in property <[string]> dash-filter-heads:   ["All Expense Heads"];
    // Insight strip
    in property <string> dash-ins-max-dr:      "—";
    in property <string> dash-ins-max-dr-narr: "";
    in property <string> dash-ins-max-cr:      "—";
    in property <string> dash-ins-max-cr-narr: "";
    in property <string> dash-ins-avg-dr:      "—";
    in property <string> dash-ins-avg-cr:      "—";
    in property <string> dash-ins-dr-count:    "";
    in property <string> dash-ins-cr-count:    "";
    in property <string> dash-ins-freq-vendor: "—";
    // Dashboard filter callbacks
    callback dash-filter-changed(string, string, string, string, string);
    // Dashboard redesign: quick-range chips in the new Period Filter Bar
    // reuse Rust's existing preset_range() date math (same helper the
    // Transactions tab's own Today/This Month/... buttons already call)
    // instead of duplicating it in Slint. See dashboard.slint's
    // PeriodFilterBar/DashboardScreen for where this is consumed.
    callback dash-date-preset(string) -> DashPresetRange;
    // Dashboard redesign: header search box — Rust does the actual
    // substring matching (Slint's expression language has no string
    // "contains") and returns matching rows via dash-search-rows below.
    callback dash-search-changed(string);
    in property <[TxnRow]> dash-search-rows: [];
    // ── Summary panel extra data ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    // Classification quality (fractions 0.0–1.0 for bar widths; counts as strings)
    in property <float>  dash-conf-hi-frac:   0.0;
    in property <float>  dash-conf-med-frac:  0.0;
    in property <string> dash-conf-hi-count:  "0";
    in property <string> dash-conf-med-count: "0";
    in property <string> dash-conf-lo-count:  "0";
    in property <string> dash-cq-ai:   "0";
    in property <string> dash-cq-rule: "0";
    in property <string> dash-cq-kw:   "0";
    // GST amounts
    in property <string> dash-gst-paid: "₹ —";
    in property <string> dash-gst-recv: "₹ —";
    // Recurring parties (top 6) and ledger breakdowns (top 8)
    in property <[SummaryListRow]> dash-parties:     [];
    in property <[SummaryListRow]> dash-per-account: [];
    in property <[SummaryListRow]> dash-rec-ledgers: [];
    in property <[SummaryListRow]> dash-pay-ledgers: [];

    in property <string> fc-all:        "0";
    in property <string> fc-unreviewed: "0";
    in property <string> fc-suspense:   "0";
    in property <string> fc-high:       "0";
    in property <string> fc-duplicates: "0";
    in property <string> fc-gst:        "0";
    in property <string> fc-review:     "0";

    // ── Toast / overlays ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    in property <string> toast-msg:           "";
    in property <int>    toast-kind:          0;  // 0=info, 1=success, 2=error, 3=warning
    // Auto-dismiss mirror of toast-msg — matches old app's ~3.2s setTimeout auto-hide.
    // toast-msg itself is a one-way `in` property driven by Rust, so we can't clear it
    // directly; toast-display is local UI state the timer below is allowed to clear.
    property <string> toast-display: "";
    in property <bool>   ocr-visible:         false;
    in property <string> ocr-msg:             "Initialising…";
    in property <int>    ocr-pct:             0;
    in property <bool>   ai-overlay-visible:  false;
    in property <string> ai-msg:              "Preparing…";
    in property <int>    ai-pct:              0;
    in property <bool>   pdf-pwd-visible:     false;
    in property <string> pdf-pwd-prompt:      "";
    in-out property <string> pdf-pwd-input:   "";
    callback pdf-pwd-confirm(string);
    callback pdf-pwd-cancel();
    callback ai-cancel();

    // ── Edit transaction (read-only display data set by Rust) ────────────────
    in property <string> edit-txn-date: "";
    in property <string> edit-txn-narr: "";
    in property <string> edit-txn-dr:   "";
    in property <string> edit-txn-cr:   "";
    in property <string> edit-txn-bank: "";
    in property <int>    edit-txn-idx:  -1;

    // ── Internal state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    in-out property <bool>   show-dashboard:  true;
    in-out property <string> active-filter:   "all";
    // Dashboard redesign — pure presentation state for the new Sidebar/
    // TopHeader shell (hamburger collapse + header search text); doesn't
    // touch any existing Transactions-tab state.
    in-out property <bool>   dash-sidebar-collapsed: false;
    in-out property <string> dash-search-text: "";
    // Period Filter Bar state (Dashboard tab only) — two-way bound straight
    // through to DashboardScreen's own dash-from/dash-to/*-idx properties.
    in-out property <string> dash-pf-from: "";
    in-out property <string> dash-pf-to:   "";
    in-out property <int>    dash-pf-bank-idx:   0;
    in-out property <int>    dash-pf-vendor-idx: 0;
    in-out property <int>    dash-pf-head-idx:   0;
    // Bank filter — tracks ComboBox selection for chip display
    private property <string> sel-bank: "All Banks";
    // Vendor / ledger-head filter — set when a summary-panel row is clicked
    private property <string> sel-vendor: "";
    private property <string> sel-head:   "";
    // Multi-status filter toggle state (set by Rust after toggle-status callback)
    in property <bool> fs-unreviewed: false;
    in property <bool> fs-suspense:   false;
    in property <bool> fs-high:       false;
    in property <bool> fs-dups:       false;
    in property <bool> fs-gst:        false;
    in property <bool> fs-review:     false;
    in property <bool> fs-credits:    false;
    in property <bool> fs-debits:     false;
    in-out property <bool>   dedup-enabled:       true;
    in-out property <bool>   ai-consent-checked:  false;
    in-out property <string> date-from:      "";
    in-out property <string> date-to:        "";
    in-out property <string> active-preset:  "";
    in-out property <string> modal-state:    "";
    // Generic confirmation modal — set confirm-title/confirm-message/confirm-action(/confirm-payload)
    // then set modal-state = "confirm"; the Yes button dispatches by confirm-action.
    in-out property <string> confirm-title:   "Please Confirm";
    in-out property <string> confirm-message: "";
    in-out property <string> confirm-action:  "";
    in-out property <int>    confirm-payload: -1;
    callback request-delete-txn-confirm(int);
    // Edit transaction editable fields
    in-out property <string> etxn-vendor: "";
    in-out property <string> etxn-head:   "";
    in-out property <int>    etxn-type-idx: 0;
    // Add transaction fields
    in-out property <string> add-date:   "";
    in-out property <string> add-ref:    "";
    in-out property <string> add-narr:   "";
    in-out property <string> add-dr:     "";
    in-out property <string> add-cr:     "";
    in-out property <string> add-vendor: "";
    in-out property <string> add-head:   "";
    in-out property <int>    add-type-idx: 0;
    // Compact mode + double-click state
    in-out property <bool>   compact-mode:      false;
    in-out property <int>    dclick-pending-idx: -1;
    // Export wizard state
    in-out property <int>    wiz-step:      1;
    in-out property <int>    wiz-sw-idx:    0;   // selected software 0=Tally 1=Zoho 2=QB 3=Odoo 4=Excel 5=XML
    in-out property <string> wiz-company:   "";
    in-out property <string> wiz-gstin:     "";
    in-out property <string> wiz-from:      "";
    in-out property <string> wiz-to:        "";
    in-out property <int>    wiz-fy-idx:    0;   // index into ["2024-25","2023-24","2022-23","2021-22"]
    in-out property <int>    wiz-state-idx: 0;   // index into the State ComboBox model below
    // Export wizard step 4 option flags
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-ob:           false;  // include opening balance entry
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-gst:          true;   // include GST details
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-ledger:       true;   // include ledger creation entries
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-narr:         true;   // include voucher narrations
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-classified:   true;   // export only classified transactions
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-skip-low:     false;  // skip low-confidence (<40%)
    in-out property <bool>   wiz-opt-skip-dup:     false;  // Requirement #10: skip duplicate-flagged transactions

    // Edit client fields — in-out so Rust can read them back
    in-out property <string> edit-client-name:   "";
    in-out property <string> edit-client-ledger: "";
    // Current client ledger name shown in summary (used to pre-fill edit modal)
    in property <string>     dash-client-ledger: "";
    // Batch monitor status line set by Rust after processing
    in property <string>          batch-log: "";
    in property <[BatchFileRow]>  batch-file-rows: [];
    // Batch pause/abort — true for the whole duration a batch is running
    // (from on_do_batch_folder's start until finish_batch's end, whether
    // that's normal completion or an abort); batch-paused toggles the
    // Pause/Resume button's label and state independently within that.
    in property <bool>            batch-running: false;
    in property <bool>            batch-paused:  false;
    callback batch-pause();
    callback batch-abort();
    // Export wizard step 4 preview (set by Rust via do-export-preview callback)
    in property <string>          export-preview-text: "";
    // Export wizard step 4 live validation (set by Rust via do-export-preview callback)
    in property <bool>            wiz-can-export: true;
    // Reconcile counters set by Rust after run-reconciliation()
    in property <string>     recon-matched:      "0";
    in property <string>     recon-likely:       "0";
    in property <string>     recon-possible:     "0";
    in property <string>     recon-unmatched:    "0";
    in property <string>     recon-bank-only:    "0";
    in property <string>     recon-status:       "";
    // Set by Rust after reconcile() (the Tally-import step)
    in property <string>     recon-file-label:   "";
    in property <bool>       recon-has-vouchers: false;
    in property <bool>       recon-has-report:   false;
    // ── Legacy data migration ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    in property <string>     migration-file-label:   "";
    in property <string>     migration-preview-text: "";
    in property <bool>       migration-has-preview:  false;
    in property <bool>       migration-running:      false;
    in property <string>     migration-status:       "";
    in property <int>        migration-pct:          0;
    in property <bool>       migration-has-report:   false;
    in property <string>     migration-report-text:  "";
    in property <bool>       migration-success:      false;
    callback migration-pick-file();
    callback migration-run();
    callback migration-save-report();
    // Audit trail records (set by Rust in do-audit-trail)
    in property <[string]>   audit-records: [];
    in property <bool>       can-undo:      false;
    callback undo-last-edit();
    in-out property <int>    audit-action-idx: 0;
    in-out property <int>    audit-type-idx:   0;

    // ── Application Settings fields (persisted via settings-save-all) ──────────
    in-out property <bool>   settings-narr-enabled:    true;
    in-out property <bool>   settings-narr-title-case: true;
    in-out property <bool>   settings-narr-preserve:   false;
    in-out property <bool>   settings-gst-enabled:     true;
    in-out property <bool>   settings-gst-auto-ledgers:true;
    in-out property <string> settings-recon-days:      "3";
    in-out property <string> settings-recon-pct:       "0.5";
    in-out property <int>    settings-log-level:       0;  // 0=INFO 1=DEBUG 2=WARN 3=ERROR
    in-out property <int>    settings-state-idx:       0;  // index into the same 9-entry state list as wiz-state-idx
    callback settings-save-all();
    callback clear-logs();

    // ── License status / activation (Phase 3A — see LICENSE_SYSTEM_DESIGN.md) ──
    in-out property <string> license-status-text:    "";
    in-out property <string> license-key-input:      "";
    in-out property <string> license-activate-result:"";
    // 0 = neutral, 1 = success, 2 = error (audit fix, 2026-08-05) — see
    // login.slint's matching property for the full rationale.
    in-out property <int>    license-activate-result-kind: 0;
    callback license-activate();
    // Re-checks the already-activated license without a key retyped
    // (audit fix, 2026-08-05 — see main.rs's on_do_license_refresh).
    callback license-refresh();
    // Reuses LoginScreen's pricing/checkout page for a logged-in user who
    // wants to switch plans (audit fix, 2026-08-05, "Upgrade flow") — see
    // app.slint's `change-plan` handler for why this drops back to the
    // login gate rather than duplicating the pricing UI here.
    callback change-plan();

    // ── MAIN LAYOUT (Transactions tab) ──────────────────────────────────────
    // Unchanged toolbar/date-bar/tab-switcher/content/footer shell — only
    // instantiated on the Transactions tab now. The Dashboard tab gets its
    // own Sidebar+Header shell below instead (Dashboard redesign); this
    // branch and everything inside it is otherwise byte-for-byte the same
    // as before the redesign.
    if !root.show-dashboard : VerticalLayout {
        padding: 0px; spacing: 0px;
        width: root.width; height: root.height;

        // ─────────────────────────── PAGE HEADER ──────────────────────────────
        // Redesigned (Phase 2): title/subtitle + the highest-frequency
        // actions (client identity, load data). The rest of the old
        // toolbar's actions (classify/rules/import/dedupe) now live in the
        // compact workflow strip directly below — same callbacks, same
        // bodies, just regrouped so nothing crowds a single row on a
        // 1366px-wide window. Every click handler below is byte-identical
        // to the old toolbar's.
        TxnPageHeader {
            title: "Transactions";
            subtitle: "Review, classify and manage bank transactions";

            Text { text: "Client:"; font-size: Type.small; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; font-weight: 600; }
            ComboBox {
                model: root.client-names; current-index: 0;
                height: 32px; min-width: 160px;
                selected(v) => { root.select-client(v); }
            }
            AppButton { text: "+ New Client"; variant: "primary"; compact: true; clicked => { root.modal-state = "new-client"; } }
            AppButton {
                text: "Edit Client"; variant: "secondary"; compact: true;
                clicked => {
                    root.edit-client-name   = root.dash-client-name;
                    root.edit-client-ledger = root.dash-client-ledger;
                    root.modal-state = "edit-client";
                }
            }
            Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 24px; background: FintechPalette.border; }
            AppButton { text: "Load File"; variant: "primary"; compact: true; clicked => { root.load-file(); } }
            AppButton {
                text: "Batch Folder"; variant: "secondary"; compact: true;
                enabled: !root.batch-running; clicked => { root.batch-folder(); }
            }
        }

        // ─────────────────────────── WORKFLOW STRIP ───────────────────────────
        // Compact secondary action row — same actions previously crammed
        // into the toolbar, unchanged behavior, just visually separated
        // from the page header above.
        Rectangle {
            height: 44px; background: FintechPalette.page-bg;
            Rectangle { y: parent.height - 1px; height: 1px; background: FintechPalette.border; }
            HorizontalBox {
                padding-left: Spacing.section; padding-right: Spacing.section; spacing: Spacing.sm;

                AppButton {
                    text: "Auto-Classify All"; variant: "secondary"; compact: true;
                    enabled: root.transaction-rows.length > 0;
                    clicked => { root.auto-classify(); }
                }
                AppButton {
                    text: "\u{2605} AI Classify"; variant: "ai"; compact: true;
                    enabled: root.transaction-rows.length > 0;
                    clicked => { root.ai-consent-checked = false; root.modal-state = "ai-consent"; }
                }
                Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 22px; background: FintechPalette.border; }
                AppButton { text: "View Rules"; variant: "ghost"; compact: true; clicked => { root.view-rules(); root.modal-state = "view-rules"; } }
                AppButton {
                    text: "Import History"; variant: "ghost"; compact: true;
                    enabled: root.transaction-rows.length > 0;
                    clicked => { root.modal-state = "import-history"; }
                }
                AppButton { text: "Import Ledgers"; variant: "ghost"; compact: true; clicked => { root.import-ledgers(); } }
                Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 22px; background: FintechPalette.border; }
                HorizontalBox {
                    padding: 0px; spacing: Spacing.xs;
                    CheckBox { text: "Dedupe"; checked <=> root.dedup-enabled; }
                }

                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }

                // .loaded-file
                if root.status-file != "" : Text {
                    text: root.status-file; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; font-size: Type.small; font-italic: true;
                    vertical-alignment: center; max-width: 220px; overflow: elide;
                }
            }
        }

        // ─────────────────────────── VIEW TABS ────────────────────────────────
        // background: navy, border-bottom: 2px solid primary — colors
        // aligned to the shared theme; structure/callbacks unchanged.
        Rectangle {
            height: 38px; background: FintechPalette.navy;

            // Bottom border
            Rectangle { y: 36px; height: 2px; background: FintechPalette.primary; }

            HorizontalBox {
                padding-left: 14px; padding-right: 14px;
                padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;
                spacing: 0px; height: 36px;
                VTab { text: "TRANSACTIONS"; active: !root.show-dashboard; clicked => { root.show-dashboard = false; } }
                VTab { text: "DASHBOARD";    active:  root.show-dashboard;  clicked => { root.show-dashboard = true;  } }
                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
            }
        }

        // ─────────────────────────── CONTENT AREA (stretch wrapper) ─────────────
        Rectangle {
            vertical-stretch: 1; clip: true;

        // ─────────────────────────── TRANSACTIONS PANEL ───────────────────────
        if !root.show-dashboard : VerticalBox {
            padding: 0px; spacing: 0px;
            width: parent.width; height: parent.height;

                // ── Filter / control card (Phase 2 redesign) ───────────────────
                // Merges the old Date Range Bar + Panel-header status
                // filters/bank selector/compact toggle/add-row into one
                // Card, as three rows — all bindings/callbacks unchanged,
                // only the container and control styling are new.
                Rectangle {
                    background: FintechPalette.page-bg;
                    VerticalBox {
                        padding-left: Spacing.section; padding-right: Spacing.section;
                        padding-top: Spacing.base; padding-bottom: Spacing.base;
                        TxnFilterCard {
                            // Row 1 — period controls (unchanged callbacks).
                            HorizontalBox {
                                padding: 0px; spacing: Spacing.sm;
                                Text {
                                    text: "PERIOD"; font-size: Type.micro; font-weight: 700;
                                    color: FintechPalette.text-muted; letter-spacing: 0.6px;
                                    vertical-alignment: center;
                                }
                                LineEdit {
                                    placeholder-text: "DD/MM/YYYY"; text: root.date-from;
                                    height: 32px; min-width: 104px; max-width: 104px; font-size: Type.small;
                                    edited(v) => { root.date-from = v; }
                                }
                                Text { text: "\u{2013}"; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; font-size: Type.body; }
                                LineEdit {
                                    placeholder-text: "DD/MM/YYYY"; text: root.date-to;
                                    height: 32px; min-width: 104px; max-width: 104px; font-size: Type.small;
                                    edited(v) => { root.date-to = v; }
                                }
                                AppButton {
                                    text: "Apply"; variant: "primary"; compact: true;
                                    clicked => { root.date-filter-apply(root.date-from, root.date-to); }
                                }
                                AppButton {
                                    text: "Clear"; variant: "secondary"; compact: true;
                                    clicked => { root.date-from = ""; root.date-to = ""; root.active-preset = ""; root.date-filter-apply("", ""); }
                                }
                                Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 20px; background: FintechPalette.border; }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Today";      active: root.active-preset == "today";      clicked => { root.active-preset = "today";      root.date-preset("today"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "This Month"; active: root.active-preset == "this_month"; clicked => { root.active-preset = "this_month"; root.date-preset("this_month"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Last Month"; active: root.active-preset == "last_month"; clicked => { root.active-preset = "last_month"; root.date-preset("last_month"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Current FY"; active: root.active-preset == "current_fy"; clicked => { root.active-preset = "current_fy"; root.date-preset("current_fy"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Prev FY";    active: root.active-preset == "prev_fy";    clicked => { root.active-preset = "prev_fy";    root.date-preset("prev_fy"); } }
                                if root.active-preset != "" : TxnActiveFilterPill {
                                    label: root.active-preset == "today"      ? "Today" :
                                           root.active-preset == "this_month" ? "This Month" :
                                           root.active-preset == "last_month" ? "Last Month" :
                                           root.active-preset == "current_fy" ? "Current FY" :
                                           root.active-preset == "prev_fy"    ? "Prev FY" : root.active-preset;
                                    accent: FintechPalette.warning;
                                    remove => { root.active-preset = ""; root.date-filter-apply("", ""); }
                                }
                                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                            }

                            // Row 2 — status chips (unchanged toggle-status/filter-changed calls).
                            HorizontalBox {
                                padding: 0px; spacing: Spacing.sm;
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "All";          count: root.fc-all;        accent: FintechPalette.primary; active: !root.fs-unreviewed && !root.fs-suspense && !root.fs-high && !root.fs-dups && !root.fs-gst && !root.fs-review && !root.fs-credits && !root.fs-debits; clicked => { root.active-filter = "all"; root.filter-changed("all"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Unreviewed";   count: root.fc-unreviewed; accent: FintechPalette.warning; active: root.fs-unreviewed; clicked => { root.toggle-status("unreviewed"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Suspense";     count: root.fc-suspense;   accent: FintechPalette.purple;  active: root.fs-suspense;   clicked => { root.toggle-status("suspense"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "High Conf.";   count: root.fc-high;       accent: FintechPalette.success; active: root.fs-high;       clicked => { root.toggle-status("high"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Duplicates";   count: root.fc-duplicates; accent: #AD1457;                active: root.fs-dups;       clicked => { root.toggle-status("duplicates"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "GST/Tax";      count: root.fc-gst;        accent: FintechPalette.teal;    active: root.fs-gst;        clicked => { root.toggle-status("gst"); } }
                                TxnStatusChip { label: "Needs Review"; count: root.fc-review;      accent: FintechPalette.warning; active: root.fs-review;     clicked => { root.toggle-status("needs_review"); } }
                                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                Text {
                                    text: root.fc-all != "0" ? root.fc-all + " transactions" : "No file loaded";
                                    font-size: Type.small; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center;
                                }
                            }

                            // Row 3 — bank / compact / add row (unchanged callbacks).
                            HorizontalBox {
                                padding: 0px; spacing: Spacing.sm;
                                Text { text: "Bank"; font-size: Type.small; font-weight: 600; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                ComboBox {
                                    model: root.bank-names; height: 32px; min-width: 140px;
                                    selected(v) => { root.sel-bank = v; root.bank-filter-changed(v); }
                                }
                                AppButton {
                                    text: root.compact-mode ? "Compact \u{2713}" : "Compact";
                                    variant: root.compact-mode ? "primary" : "secondary"; compact: true;
                                    clicked => { root.compact-mode = !root.compact-mode; }
                                }
                                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                Text { text: "(double-click to edit)"; font-size: Type.micro; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                AppButton {
                                    text: "+ Add Row"; variant: "secondary"; compact: true;
                                    enabled: root.transaction-rows.length > 0;
                                    clicked => {
                                        root.add-date = ""; root.add-ref = ""; root.add-narr = "";
                                        root.add-dr = ""; root.add-cr = "";
                                        root.add-vendor = ""; root.add-head = "";
                                        root.add-type-idx = 0;
                                        root.add-row();
                                        root.modal-state = "add-txn";
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }

                // ── Active filter chip bar (shown when any status/bank filter is on) ──────
                // Same conditions/callbacks as before — restyled with the
                // shared TxnActiveFilterPill instead of one-off pill markup.
                if root.fs-unreviewed || root.fs-suspense || root.fs-high || root.fs-dups || root.fs-gst || root.fs-review || root.fs-credits || root.fs-debits || (root.sel-bank != "All Banks" && root.sel-bank != "") || root.sel-vendor != "" || root.sel-head != "" : Rectangle {
                    height: 40px; background: FintechPalette.page-bg;
                    Rectangle { y: 0px; height: 1px; background: FintechPalette.border; width: parent.width; }
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        padding-left: Spacing.section; padding-right: Spacing.section;
                        padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; spacing: Spacing.sm; alignment: start;
                        Text { text: "Filters:"; font-size: Type.micro; font-weight: 700; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; }
                        if root.fs-unreviewed : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Unreviewed"; accent: FintechPalette.warning; remove => { root.toggle-status("unreviewed"); } }
                        if root.fs-suspense   : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Suspense";   accent: FintechPalette.purple;  remove => { root.toggle-status("suspense"); } }
                        if root.fs-high       : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "High Conf."; accent: FintechPalette.success; remove => { root.toggle-status("high"); } }
                        if root.fs-dups       : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Duplicates"; accent: #AD1457;                remove => { root.toggle-status("duplicates"); } }
                        if root.fs-gst        : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "GST/Tax";    accent: FintechPalette.teal;    remove => { root.toggle-status("gst"); } }
                        if root.fs-review     : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Needs Review"; accent: FintechPalette.warning; remove => { root.toggle-status("needs_review"); } }
                        if root.fs-credits    : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Credits Only"; accent: FintechPalette.success; remove => { root.toggle-status("credits"); } }
                        if root.fs-debits     : TxnActiveFilterPill { label: "Debits Only";  accent: FintechPalette.danger;  remove => { root.toggle-status("debits"); } }
                        if root.sel-bank != "All Banks" && root.sel-bank != "" : TxnActiveFilterPill {
                            label: root.sel-bank; accent: FintechPalette.navy;
                            remove => { root.sel-bank = "All Banks"; root.bank-filter-changed("All Banks"); }
                        }
                        if root.sel-vendor != "" : TxnActiveFilterPill {
                            label: root.sel-vendor; accent: FintechPalette.purple;
                            remove => { root.sel-vendor = ""; root.vendor-filter-changed(""); }
                        }
                        if root.sel-head != "" : TxnActiveFilterPill {
                            label: root.sel-head; accent: FintechPalette.teal;
                            remove => { root.sel-head = ""; root.head-filter-changed(""); }
                        }
                        Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                        AppButton {
                            text: "Clear All"; variant: "ghost"; compact: true;
                            clicked => {
                                root.sel-bank = "All Banks"; root.sel-vendor = ""; root.sel-head = "";
                                root.active-filter = "all"; root.filter-changed("all");
                                root.bank-filter-changed("All Banks"); root.vendor-filter-changed(""); root.head-filter-changed("");
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }

                // Table + Summary
                HorizontalBox {
                    padding: 0px; spacing: 0px; vertical-stretch: 1;

                    // Transaction table — redesigned TxnTable (sticky header,
                    // synced horizontal+vertical scroll); same rows/compact/
                    // click-index contract the old TxnHeader+ListView+
                    // TxnTableRow trio exchanged with this screen.
                    Rectangle {
                        horizontal-stretch: 4; background: FintechPalette.card; clip: true;

                        VerticalBox {
                            padding: 0px; spacing: 0px;

                            if root.transaction-rows.length == 0 : VerticalBox {
                                alignment: center; spacing: Spacing.md;
                                Text {
                                    text: "Select a client, then load a bank statement (Excel .xlsx / .xls)";
                                    font-size: Type.h3; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; font-italic: true;
                                    horizontal-alignment: center; wrap: word-wrap;
                                }
                            }

                            if root.transaction-rows.length > 0 : TxnTable {
                                vertical-stretch: 1;
                                rows: root.transaction-rows;
                                compact: root.compact-mode;
                                selected-idx: root.dclick-pending-idx;
                                row-clicked(i) => {
                                    if root.dclick-pending-idx == i {
                                        root.row-click(i);
                                        root.etxn-vendor = "";
                                        root.etxn-head   = "";
                                        root.etxn-type-idx = 0;
                                        root.modal-state = "edit-txn";
                                        root.dclick-pending-idx = -1;
                                    } else {
                                        root.dclick-pending-idx = i;
                                    }
                                }
                            }

                            // Colour key — restyled with the shared Badge
                            // component; same six row-color/tag/status
                            // legend entries as before.
                            if root.transaction-rows.length > 0 : Rectangle {
                                height: 32px; background: FintechPalette.page-bg;
                                Rectangle { y: 0px; height: 1px; background: FintechPalette.border; }

                                HorizontalBox {
                                    padding-left: Spacing.section; padding-right: Spacing.section;
                                    padding-top: Spacing.xs; padding-bottom: Spacing.xs;
                                    spacing: Spacing.base;

                                    for item in [
                                        {lbl: "High Conf.", dot: #A5D6A7},
                                        {lbl: "Medium",     dot: #FFF176},
                                        {lbl: "Needs Review", dot: #EF9A9A},
                                        {lbl: "Suspense",   dot: #CE93D8},
                                        {lbl: "Manual",     dot: #90CAF9},
                                        {lbl: "Duplicate",  dot: #F8BBD0},
                                    ] : HorizontalBox {
                                        padding: 0px; spacing: Spacing.xs; alignment: center;
                                        Rectangle { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; background: item.dot; }
                                        Text { text: item.lbl; font-size: Type.micro; color: FintechPalette.text-muted; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                    }

                                    Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 16px; background: FintechPalette.border; }

                                    for tag in [
                                        {lbl: "GST", fg: #1B5E20, bg: #C8E6C9},
                                        {lbl: "TAX", fg: #BF360C, bg: #FFE0B2},
                                        {lbl: "DUP", fg: #880E4F, bg: #FCE4EC},
                                    ] : Badge { text: tag.lbl; fg: tag.fg; bg: tag.bg; }

                                    Rectangle { width: 1px; height: 16px; background: FintechPalette.border; }

                                    for chip in [
                                        {lbl: "HIGH",     fg: #1B5E20, bg: #C8E6C9},
                                        {lbl: "REVIEW",   fg: #B71C1C, bg: #FFCDD2},
                                        {lbl: "SUSPENSE", fg: #6A1B9A, bg: #E1BEE7},
                                    ] : Badge { text: chip.lbl; fg: chip.fg; bg: chip.bg; }

                                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }

                    // Summary panel — redesigned (Phase 2): Card-based
                    // sections instead of one long divider-separated list.
                    // Every SR/value/callback below is unchanged; only the
